        "text": "I have political playlists.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "We are here to provide different avenues for people to engage with politics.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Many people feel disconnected from the political system today.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Many people feel that the political system is broken.",
        "confidence": 0.88
