        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "Local school boards and superintendents are the actual decision-makers in education policy.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Looking to Washington to solve education problems can feel overwhelming or futile.",
        "confidence": 0.94
