        "text": "The effectiveness of political influence depends on proximity to decision-making bodies.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Constituents value local control over education more than federal intervention.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Political action is more effective when grounded in grassroots mobilization rather than top-down solutions.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
