    "turn_text": "Well, I want to move topics and talk about China. I know you sit on a China house, you know, task force. And, you know, China has just been a hot topic over the last couple of years. And I think it will continue to be, you know, going forward. So what do you believe are the biggest threats right now to our national security from China?",
