        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes the listener’s opinion on Chinese threats to U.S. national security is valuable and worth seeking.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Discussing China’s impact on national security is appropriate within this conversational context.",
